rosoft/vcpkg/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/deployments","created_at":"2016-09-15T16:40:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T05:34:58Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T03:27:24Z","git_url":"git://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:microsoft/vcpkg.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg","homepage":"","size":96040,"stargazers_count":26254,"watchers_count":26254,"language":"CMake","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":7235,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1320,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["c","cmake","cplusplus","cpp","libraries","package-manager","packages","vcpkg","visual-studio","windows"],"visibility":"public","forks":7235,"open_issues":1320,"watchers":26254,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"# Bad User Experience\r\n\r\nThe auto-generated usage information is wrong for many non-trivial ports. \r\n\r\n## Earlier reports\r\n\r\n - #10881\r\n\r\n## Known problem ports\r\n - `azure-iot-sdk-c` (lists 4 out of 10 targets in one line, too much)\r\n - `grpc` (references a `modules` target, #17177)\r\n - `hdf5` (listing all targets, which is too much)\r\n - `iir1`(config in wrong dir, https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/23940)\r\n - `itk` (promoting bad practice, see below,  #22641)\r\n - `jsoncpp` (3 targets in one line, https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/20190#issuecomment-1082735779)\r\n - `libpng` (reporting different targets for static vs. dynamic instead of CMake Find module, #23379)\r\n - `openimageio` (references a `Module` target, #21234)\r\n - `openxr-loader` (config in wrong dir,  #23928)\r\n - `qhull` (listing all targets, which is too much)\r\n - `qt5-base` (listing targets which are private implementation details, and duplicate targets, cf. https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/14907#issuecomment-1024871325-)\r\n - `realsense2` (lists four targets, https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/20190#issuecomment-1084750479)\r\n - `shapelib` (no config file to match the proposed package name, #16041, https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/20190#issuecomment-1124553735)\r\n\r\n## Patched by usage file\r\n - `arrow` (references an `arrow_bundled_dependencies` library which doesn't exist in absence of vendored dependencies, #20459)\r\n - `c-ares` (lists `c-ares::cares c-ares::cares_shared c-ares::cares_static`)\r\n - `drogon`(picks targets from conditional `find_dependency` helpers, https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/20190#issuecomment-1008044822)\r\n - `libiconv` (see below, from #14994; #22539)\r\n - `mailio` (reports a `cmake` package, #23798)\r\n - `vtk` (original output cf. #19035)\r\n\r\n## Other resolved\r\n\r\n - `effolkronium-random` (config in wrong dir, #20795)\r\n - `sentry-native` (config in wrong dir, https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/pull/24309#pullrequestreview-951333878)\r\n\r\n## Misguided patching in vcpkg\r\n - `libgeotiff` 1.6.1 (#15750 diverging from upstream)\r\n\r\n# Promoting Bad Practice\r\n\r\nAll targets are listed in the same `target_link_libraries` line. But normally, canonical usage is to use only a single desired target and let it pull in its transitive usage requirements. \r\n\r\nSome package do export targets not as public interface, but as an implementation detail hidden behind interface variables. By automatic reporting of targes, vcpkg distracts user from applying canonical usage, contributors from researching, documenting and testing canonical usage, and team members to base there support answers on canonical usage.\r\n\r\n# Example: User experience for libiconv\r\n\r\n> but when i run the command  `vcpkg install libiconv`, it always tell me\r\n> ```\r\n> ubuntu@o-01:~/vcpkg$ vcpkg install libiconv\r\n> Computing installation plan...\r\n> The following packages are already installed:\r\n>     libiconv[core]:x64-linux -> 1.16#11\r\n> Package libiconv:x64-linux is already installed\r\n> Restored 0 packages from /home/ubuntu/.cache/vcpkg/archives in 1.052 us. Use --debug to see more details.\r\n> \r\n> Total elapsed time: 37.06 us\r\n> \r\n> The package libiconv provides CMake targets:\r\n> \r\n>     find_package(iconv CONFIG REQUIRED)\r\n>     target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Iconv::Charset)\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> please fix the issue.\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @ssrlive in https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/14994#issuecomment-920596707_","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/20190/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/20190/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":6314707159,"node_id":"AE_lADOBBJcqc5Ge_h2zwAAAAF4YsjX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events/6314707159","actor":{"login":"JonLiu1993","id":63675417,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNjc1NDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63675417?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonLiu1993","html_url":"https://github.com/JonLiu1993","followers_url":"ht